      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LAKEVIEW LEIGH (2) turned spotting a big start finishing seventh (30.77) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Has ability and is a key runner. WHITE MOCHA (7) looks overdue for a win having finished in the minors at her last three runs, the latest when second (29.83) at this track. Has never been out of the money in three starts this distance. Looks well placed here and has the ability. Go well. STARLET BALE (1) had a tough draw to overcome and was game in defeat when only 1.5 lengths from Cheeky Chompers in third (30.12) at The Meadows. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to her credit. Expected to feature. RHYTHMIC ENERGY (8) is building a nice sequence of placings – hard to fault that form.",
